    "text": "By the ReUse It Center ,\n12 hours ago McPHERSON, Kan. — The ReUse It Center was able to donate $4,500 this month thanks to its shoppers and volunteers. Outreach McPherson is a nonprofit ministry that distributes new or used furniture to those in need. They collect furniture and store it in storage units until there is a request. They accept new and gently used furniture such as couches, tables, chairs, beds, dressers and more. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
